From: "mumeyong.dev" <64839630+mumeyong@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:33:18 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Rebrand UI as mumeyong

Replace user-visible "Ambxst" text (settings title, notch label,
notifications, keybind labels, mods dialogs, translations) and the logo
and icon assets with the mumeyong mark. Internal identifiers (ambxst CLI,
paths, upstream URLs, preset folder, Qt color-scheme name) are unchanged.

The About entry credits upstream: "Based on Ambxst <version> by Axenide",
linking to https://axeni.de/ambxst. Ambxst is AGPL-3.0; its LICENSE files
are kept.
